  "title": {
   "en": "Koushaku-ke no Aisare Nise Youjo"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "公爵家の愛されニセ幼女"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Beloved Fake Little Girl of the Duke Family"
   },
   {
    "en": "The spoiled fake daughter of the duk's family"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Sophia, the daughter of a viscount’s family, lived a harsh life trapped in a tower of mages — working day and night until she nearly collapsed from exhaustion.\nBut the worst part? She discovered that the very mage she trusted the most — the one who gave her strength to endure — was actually the one secretly ordering her torment.\n\nDevastated and heartbroken, Sophia decided to escape that hell.\nBut escaping wasn’t easy… so she resorted to one desperate solution:\ncreating a potion that would turn her into a small child!\n\nAnd it worked.\nWith her youthful appearance restored, she fled far from the tower — and stumbled into a life she never could have imagined.\n\nA powerful ducal family took her in as their adopted daughter, showering her with love and affection she had never known.\nA gentle father, a doting older brother who spoils her endlessly…\nAnd best of all? No more work!\n\nBut peace never lasts forever.\nOne day, a young boy her age named Adam, the son of another duke, appears before her — and starts approaching her with mysterious kindness.\n\nAnd so begins a heartwarming and hilarious daily life between a runaway girl turned child… and a noble boy with secrets of his own,\nin a world full of love, pampering, and charming little adventures."
  },
